# CMDEDIT-LBL-01: Cell bbox 0 0 90 90; label IN with the box in each of 9 regions.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 90 90
paint metal1
box 15 15 15 15
label IN
box 45 15 45 15
label IN
box 75 15 75 15
label IN
box 15 45 15 45
label IN
box 45 45 45 45
label IN
box 75 45 75 45
label IN
box 15 75 15 75
label IN
box 45 75 45 75
label IN
box 75 75 75 75
label IN
save a
